/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>好多闪亮亮的碎片，就是刺得我有点痛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洁西卡摸摸背部，又摸摸腿儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>嗯？闪亮亮下面好像夹着什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>这是……</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"9\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图书馆巨大的镜子，带着细细的雕花的把手，只要按住它轻轻向上抬，露出的那一道狭小缝隙——“书中人”就在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>太好了，玛蒂尔达的卷子还在！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>她的字迹可真漂亮，试卷上还有香香的味道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洁西卡：</div><div>阿……阿嚏！</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞跃旧屋之墙-图书馆"}}